<title>USA: Hayes Wheels Intl wins Porsche contract.</title>
<headline>Hayes Wheels Intl wins Porsche contract.</headline>
<dateline>ROMULUS, Mich. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hayes Wheels International Inc said Thursday it won a contract to supply cast aluminum wheels for Porsche AG's new entry-level roadster, the Boxster.</p>
<p>Providing high-technology wheels for a high-profile vehicle like the 1997 Boxster could help Hayes Wheels expand its customer base in Western Europe, said a company official.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the Porsche contract were not announced.</p>
<p>Hayes Wheels International is a designer and manufacturer of steel and aluminum wheels and brake parts.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
